# Whitelist: ignore everything in ~/.claude by default, since most of it is
# session data, caches, or credentials that shouldn't go in a public dotfiles repo.
# Only the specific files below are tracked.
*

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!statusline-command.sh
!hooks
!hooks/mdview-queue.sh
!skills
!skills/writing-for-me
!skills/writing-for-me/**
!skills/herdr
!skills/herdr/**
!skills/herdr-guide
!skills/herdr-guide/**
!themes
!themes/custom-dark.json
!rules
!rules/*.md
